Found the exact commit when this happens and updated the issue with it:
299902e34d32c4ea77bf2c8b9b13c68f45113f13 | @yash-atreya this could be similar to the access issue, ptal

@vicnaum could you perhaps provide a repro for this? | This is likely because earlier we'd treat a delegatecall as call with `expectCall`.

Repro for this would look like this:
```solidity
contract Simple {
    function initialize() public {}
}

contract SimpleProxy {
    function initialize(Simple impl) public {
        address(impl).delegatecall(abi.encodeWithSignature("initialize()"));
    }
}

contract BugTest is Script {
    function test() public {
        SimpleProxy proxy = new SimpleProxy();
        Simple impl = new Simple();

        vm.expectCall(address(impl), abi.encodeWithSignature("initialize()"));
        proxy.initialize(impl);
    }
}
```

